           <table width="82%" border="0" align="center" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0">
  <tr>
    <td height="30" align="left" style="font-size:14px"><a href="/1/558/558535.htm" target="_blank" title="华为nova 2s上四摄：只比Mate 10少个徕卡"><span class="title1">华为nova 2s上四摄：只比Mate 10少个徕卡</span></a>　<img src="/images/c-l-g-t-01.gif" width="12" height="11" /> <span class="f12g">上方文Q</span> <img src="/images/c-l-g-t-02.gif" width="12" height="11" /> <span class="f12g">15:32:31</span></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td align="left"><p>华为近期新机不断，而今天最新面世的nova 2s堪称&ldquo;集大成者&rdquo;，汇聚了Mate 10、荣耀V10、麦芒6的诸多特点，同样也有全面屏加持，主打年轻用户群体。</p>
<p><strong>nova 2s是华为的第四款全面屏手机</strong>，并且类似荣耀V10，<strong>在正面底部狭窄的&ldquo;下巴&rdquo;上整合了指纹识别实体键，还可兼做系统导航。</strong></p>
<p>作为一款青春机，nova 2s的一大核心任务就是拍照和自拍，为<strong>此配备了前置双摄、后置双摄，总共四个摄像头，这也是继麦芒6之后的华为第二款四摄机型。</strong></p>
<p align="center"><strong><a href="/img/20171207/52c7b07b15b84caab6b66b2010edef49.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="华为nova 2s上四摄：只比Mate 10少个徕卡" src="/img/20171207/s_52c7b07b15b84caab6b66b2010edef49.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></strong></p>
<p><strong>前置为2000万+200万像素，分别负责高清成像和景深识别，支持单反级大光圈背景虚化、先拍照后对焦、精准面部立体识别、人景分离，同时升级了美颜算法，在不同场景、光线下可以保持面部亮度、肤色的一致，并有趣味变装、百变背景玩法。</strong></p>
<p>华为同时还为它配备了<strong>广光谱还原柔光灯</strong>，可智能识别环境光，自动切换两档亮度，色彩还原精度达90％。</p>
<p align="center"><a href="/img/20171207/c64146a00adb43b9b6ef110d5b7365c7.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="华为nova 2s上四摄：只比Mate 10少个徕卡" src="/img/20171207/s_c64146a00adb43b9b6ef110d5b7365c7.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></p>
<p align="center"><a href="/img/20171207/682c0cdf9ca64a419772a65aa3b36d31.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="华为nova 2s上四摄：只比Mate 10少个徕卡" src="/img/20171207/s_682c0cdf9ca64a419772a65aa3b36d31.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></p>
<p align="center"><a href="/img/20171207/12ce09d7699642a0adf3f697c836841c.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="华为nova 2s上四摄：只比Mate 10少个徕卡" src="/img/20171207/s_12ce09d7699642a0adf3f697c836841c.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></p>
<p align="center"><a href="/img/20171207/e87644ab2c5941818c9d436becd639d2.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="华为nova 2s上四摄：只比Mate 10少个徕卡" src="/img/20171207/s_e87644ab2c5941818c9d436becd639d2.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></p>
<p align="center"><a href="/img/20171207/5a4a2c1acf61407b9ae985cb78038e3b.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="华为nova 2s上四摄：只比Mate 10少个徕卡" src="/img/20171207/s_5a4a2c1acf61407b9ae985cb78038e3b.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></p>
<p align="center"><a href="/img/20171207/8943d2d1a0c242a9835bb7f042fd0b54.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="华为nova 2s上四摄：只比Mate 10少个徕卡" src="/img/20171207/s_8943d2d1a0c242a9835bb7f042fd0b54.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></p>
<p align="center"><a href="/img/20171207/ab0dbfaa25fa42498ab82f465e8d5891.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="华为nova 2s上四摄：只比Mate 10少个徕卡" src="/img/20171207/s_ab0dbfaa25fa42498ab82f465e8d5891.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></p>
<p><strong>后置为2000万像素黑白+1200万像素彩色，光圈均为F1.8，号称仿生双摄像头，可同步采集多帧图像，均衡图片中的明暗场景亮度。</strong></p>
<p>相比于Mate 10的后置双摄，nova 2s可以说<strong>只是没有了徕卡调校和认证</strong>。虽然处理器是麒麟960，没有麒麟970那样的独立AI加持，但华为也为其融入了<strong>基于人工智能图像识别技术的动态特写，可以自动视频跟焦。</strong></p>
<p>另外还有大光圈虚化效果层次丰富的<strong>人像模式</strong>，<strong>暗光拍摄</strong>也可多帧融合提升亮度和细节。</p>
<p align="center"><a href="/img/20171207/53de197dc59247acbbe6f5864378d23f.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="华为nova 2s上四摄：只比Mate 10少个徕卡" src="/img/20171207/s_53de197dc59247acbbe6f5864378d23f.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></p>
<p align="center"><a href="/img/20171207/bcb1838736e14852a7b38cd22112ccc7.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="华为nova 2s上四摄：只比Mate 10少个徕卡" src="/img/20171207/s_bcb1838736e14852a7b38cd22112ccc7.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></p>
<p align="center"><a href="/img/20171207/3e221138df6349899962fc8ac1265889.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="华为nova 2s上四摄：只比Mate 10少个徕卡" src="/img/20171207/s_3e221138df6349899962fc8ac1265889.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></p>
<p align="center"><a href="/img/20171207/df10bb4429564158943f2e414b9bf18d.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="华为nova 2s上四摄：只比Mate 10少个徕卡" src="/img/20171207/s_df10bb4429564158943f2e414b9bf18d.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></p>
<p align="center"><a href="/img/20171207/0528555dcd2e423aab0c1654bcb3a539.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="华为nova 2s上四摄：只比Mate 10少个徕卡" src="/img/20171207/s_0528555dcd2e423aab0c1654bcb3a539.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></p>
<p align="center"><a href="/img/20171207/bea1ef88a0d24e3ba8a32c5793284000.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="华为nova 2s上四摄：只比Mate 10少个徕卡" src="/img/20171207/s_bea1ef88a0d24e3ba8a32c5793284000.jpg" style="border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid; border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid" /></a></p>
</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><hr align="center" color="#ffffff" size="1" /></td>
  </tr>
</table>
            
           <table width="82%" border="0" align="center" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0">
  <tr>
    <td height="30" align="left" style="font-size:14px"><a href="/1/558/558534.htm" target="_blank" title="三星W2018旗舰图赏：经典翻盖设计 奢华尊贵"><span class="title1">三星W2018旗舰图赏：经典翻盖设计 奢华尊贵</span></a>　<img src="/images/c-l-g-t-01.gif" width="12" height="11" /> <span class="f12g">振亭</span> <img src="/images/c-l-g-t-02.gif" width="12" height="11" /> <span class="f12g">15:18:43</span></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td align="left"><p>12月1日，三星在厦门发布了商务旗舰W2018。</p>
<p>作为W系列的一员，三星W2018依然延续了翻盖式设计，并且采用了金属与玻璃结合的语言。手机转轴部分采用锌合金一体成型双轴铰链，导航键部分采用星芒纹饰设计，并经过126道激光雕刻，质感十足。</p>
<p>规格方面，<strong>三星W2018内外配备两块4.2英寸1080P屏幕，均采用康宁第五代大猩猩玻璃，搭载高通骁龙835处理器，有64GB（至尊版）和256GB（典藏版）两种存储规格，电池容量为2300mAh。</strong></p>
<p>拍照方面，<strong>该机拥有前置500万+后置1200万像素摄像头。拥有F1.5超大光圈，支持双核对焦和OIS光学防抖。</strong>可根据场景智能切换光圈，暗光情况下会自动切换至F1.5大光圈，而光线充足时则切换为F2.4光圈。</p>
<p>功能方面，三星W2018加入了Bixby语音助手，并在机身侧面增加了Bixby启动按钮。Bixby除了语音操作还有图像识别、自定义口令等功能。</p>
<p>下面我们来欣赏下<a class="f14_link" href="http://slide.tech.sina.com.cn/mobile/slide_5_22298_104925.html/d/1#p=1" target="_blank">新浪科技</a>带来的真机图赏，一起来看看。</p>
<p align="center"><a href="/img/20171207/388892c3a2a2444a96a4dfa0e5a38a2f.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="三星W2018旗舰图赏：经典翻盖设计 奢华尊贵" src="/img/20171207/s_388892c3a2a2444a96a4dfa0e5a38a2f.jpg" style="border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid; border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid" /></a></p>
