<p>Mac版：<a class="f14_link" href="https://dl.google.com/chrome/mac/stable/GGRO/googlechrome.dmg" target="_blank">点击这里</a></p>
<p align="center"><a href="/img/20171207/c92a031b6adb435c9405b1de7a5a49a4.jpeg" target="_blank"><img alt="全平台Chrome 63正式版发布" src="/img/20171207/s_c92a031b6adb435c9405b1de7a5a49a4.jpeg" style="border-bottom: black 1px solid; border-left: black 1px solid; border-top: black 1px solid; border-right: black 1px solid" /></a></p>
</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><hr align="center" color="#ffffff" size="1" /></td>
